From 36f3bd26a9a7773c527bc746a5ab2196a9a28bd9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:24:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] guest: admit measured sealed-resource mounts

Verify manifest-authorized descriptors after cloud mount rewriting and
before container dispatch. Read bounded inputs through os.Root and write
only verified plaintext into private tmpfs. Clean the private files when
container creation fails or container/sandbox removal succeeds.

Extend the existing mount transaction with a sealed-rejection regression;
plain-volume rollback remains owned by the generic lifecycle patch.

Co-authored-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
